{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51830","headline":"赠妓（详纵情诗酒，至庐江谒郡守，留连吟醉，因赠妓曰：） · 郑详","name":"赠妓（详纵情诗酒，至庐江谒郡守，留连吟醉，因赠妓曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台盘阔狭才三尺，似隔中当有阻艰。\n若不骑龙与骑凤，乐营门是望夫山。\n（《诗话总龟》二三《寓情门》引《南部新书》）（〖1〗《登科记考》卷二二载会昌四年登进士第者有郑祥，汉南人，疑即此人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}